### ================================================================
### 🔑 Hidden Gems SL — BYOM & API Key Validation Tests
### VS Code REST Client Extension හරහා run කරන්න
### Extension: humao.rest-client
###
### 📌 How to Use:
###   1. පහළ "▶ Send Request" button එක click කරලා ඔයාගේ Local Backends සහ APIs චෙක් කරන්න
###   2. ✅ = 200/OK (Server & AI working!), ❌ = Connection refused / 401 / 500
### ================================================================

### ── 🔧 Local & BYOM Variables (ඔයාගේ Local Endpoints මෙතන තියෙන්නේ) ──
@python_backend     = http://localhost:8000/api
@laravel_backend    = http://localhost:8888/api/v1
@custom_food_scan   = http://localhost:8000/api/food/scan
@internal_api_key   = dev-key-local

### ================================================================
### 🏛️ PART 1: SELF-HOSTED BYOM ARCHITECTURE TESTS (Local Models)
###    මෙම පරීක්ෂණ හරහා ඔයාගේ Local Python, Laravel සහ Custom AI වැඩදැයි බලාගත හැක.
### ================================================================

### 1️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — WEATHER ALERTS TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Weather alerts JSON from local monsoon monitor
# @name python_weather_test
GET {{python_backend}}/weather/alerts

###

### 2️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — LUMEN-1 AI STATUS TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Lumen model availability status
# @name lumen_status_test
GET {{python_backend}}/status

###

### 3️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — LUMEN-1 AI CHAT INFERENCE TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + AI response text from D:\ai model\lumen-1
# @name lumen_inference_test
POST {{python_backend}}/test-model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Ayubowan! Suggest one hidden waterfall in Sri Lanka.",
  "use_rag": true,
  "mode": "tourist",
  "temperature": 0.7
}

###

### 4️⃣ PYTHON BACKEND — AI TRANSLATION TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Translated Sinhala/English text
# @name ai_translate_test
POST {{python_backend}}/ai/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Welcome to Sri Lanka, the pearl of the Indian Ocean!",
  "target_lang": "si"
}

###

### 5️⃣ LARAVEL GATEWAY — PLACE SYNC VERSION CHECK
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + {"version": ...}
# @name laravel_sync_test
GET {{laravel_backend}}/places/check-version

###

### 6️⃣ LARAVEL GATEWAY → PYTHON AI PROXY TEST (Itinerary Planner)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + TripItinerary JSON generated by Python via Laravel Proxy
# @name laravel_ai_proxy_test
POST {{laravel_backend}}/ai/plan-itinerary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Kandy",
  "days": 2,
  "style": "balanced",
  "budget_lkr": 50000
}

###

### 7️⃣ CUSTOM FOOD SCAN AI — BYOM VISION TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Dish Identification JSON
# @name byom_food_scan_test
POST {{custom_food_scan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
  "user_mode": "Tourist",
  "spice_preference": "Medium"
}


### ================================================================
### 🌐 PART 2: LEGACY CLOUD API TESTS (Optional BYOM Fallback Only)
###    ඔයාට අවශ්‍ය නම් පමණක් බාහිර Commercial API Keys චෙක් කිරීමට මෙය භාවිතා කරන්න.
### ================================================================

@gemini_api_key     = YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE
@weather_api_key    = YOUR_WEATHER_API_KEY_HERE
@firebase_api_key   = YOUR_FIREBASE_API_KEY_HERE
@firebase_project   = YOUR_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID

### 8️⃣ GEMINI API KEY TEST (Legacy Commercial Cloud)
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + JSON with "candidates" field
# @name gemini_key_test
POST https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key={{gemini_api_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": [
    {
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Say Ayubowan in one word"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### 9️⃣ OPENWEATHERMAP API KEY TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + Colombo weather JSON
# @name weather_key_test
GET https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather?q=Colombo&appid={{weather_api_key}}&units=metric

###

### 🔟 FIREBASE AUTH — API KEY TEST
###    ✅ Success: HTTP 200 + {"kind": "identitytoolkit..."}
# @name firebase_key_test
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key={{firebase_api_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnSecureToken": true
}
